spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/PLAN.md-54-## T7 — Client correlation by clientMessageId
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/PLAN.md-55-Reasoning: Every pending/stored match in the outbox and across 
tabs depends on key-based correlation; it is observable on its own (AC-050).
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/PLAN.md-56-Task: The sender's representations of a message (create/fence 
