spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/PLAN.md-162-## T18 — Mention desktop notifications
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/PLAN.md-163-Reasoning: Extends the Phase 4 notification claim with mention 
eligibility, emission-time authorization, and browser-wide suppression.
spec-interview/phase-5-messaging-resilience/PLAN.md-164-Task: With the Phase 4 toggle on and permission granted, a 
mentioned user gets one notification per message (DM, group, room, thread reply) titled "<Autor> mencionou você em 
