12:  * credentials). It never writes product data through a side door for a test
13:  * scenario: memberships change only through the seed route (service-role
14:  * DELETE = revocation; restore_conversation_membership = re-add), and budgets
15:  * are charged by the real `public.check_rate_limit`. Direct writes here are
16:  * limited to (a) raising an already-charged counter row to "exhausted" and
17:  * (b) deleting test-account state during cleanup.
