connectivity returns, with ≤ 10 pending and quota available all delivered within 10 s; confirmed items become the 
normal message; the outbox survives reload and tab close; attachments/voice are never queued (Phase 4 behavior kept); 
if the outbox write fails or storage is unavailable, nothing is dispatched and the text and reply stay with the D5 
